<title>USA: FTC clears Time Warner-Turner merger.</title>
<headline>FTC clears Time Warner-Turner merger.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Trade Commission said Thursday it approved Time Warner Inc.'s purchase of Turner Broadcasting System Inc. after requiring changes to the $6.5 billion merger.</p>
<p>The FTC, in a 3-2 vote, agreed to permit the acquisition after the deal was revised to curb Tele-Communications Inc.'s influence over the new company formed by the merger. The deal, once formally completed, will create the world's largest media and entertainment concern.</p>
</text>
